  "full_text": "So as high priest, the purpose of man is to entertain God. You should bring glory to God. He wants to be glorified for his creation. So Africa, get all niggerlicious and gloriously African. Because it's not good. I think it should be cut off from white people and become more gloriously African. All governments should seek to glorify and entertain God as their prime directive. So, as high priest, any country that does not make it into the world news every month will be subject to a temple tax increase. You have to get in the world news every month or you're fucked, okay? So, entertain God or you get temple taxed. Like all those, just think about the Middle East. What if they didn't have war? Oh, my God. Do you know what a depressing place that is? Holy fuck. I guess they got architecture and shit and geometry and stuff. But, like, I mean, like, what about all those Kazakhstan's and stuff? Those stands in, like, Eastern Europe and shit? Those places sound depressing as fuck. It's like, why do you exist? You know, you better, like, entertain God.",
